      "text": "1- Tablar\u0131n kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 ve alanlar\u0131n a\u00E7\u0131k gelmesi",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1- Tablar\u0131n kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 ve alanlar\u0131n a\u00E7\u0131k gelmesi",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UgzvMOIpx-ahmlZhnFFxb",
